docs {
  ### Create Job
  Creates a new job post. The owner information is populated from the authenticated user token.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (Inherited)
  
  #### Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-string",
      "owner": "uuid-string",
      "category": "90e290f9-a682-4fdb-bb8e-1d638706d860",
      "title": "Need a NestJS expert to debug container networking",
      "slug": "need-a-nestjs-expert-to-debug-container-networking-20260624003000",
      "description": "...",
      "type": "contract",
      "budget": "$100-500",
      "deadline": "2026-07-01T12:00:00.000Z",
      "location": "Remote",
      "required_skills": [...],
      "tags": [...],
      "status": "active",
      "created_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z"
    },
    "message": "Job created successfully"
  }
  ```
}
